From: gabrielolympie <gab.olympie@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 01:37:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] sm120: fp8 weight-only for HC mix and decode-size lm_head

HC mix persistent kernel gains an FP8W path (per-row scales applied after
each dot): 14.5 -> 10.8 us/mix. lm_head decode logits route through the fp8
GEMV when SGLANG_SM120_LM_HEAD_FP8 is set (chunked rowwise quantization: a
full-tensor fp32 temp of the 1.27 GB lm_head OOMs a 0.96-mem-fraction
server). The fp8 lm_head also halves every MTP draft step's logits GEMV.

C1 greedy median 163.5 -> 188.8 (best 193.3), C4 477 -> 529. Accept length
unchanged (2.2-2.5); greedy/needles/5x GSM spot checks all pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
